{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-cost-tradeoffs","title":"延迟与成本取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/latency-cost-tradeoffs","wordCount":1302,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟与成本取舍\">延迟与成本取舍</h1><p>重排能提精度，但精度不是免费的——它直接换成毫秒和美元。<a href=\"../rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器重排</a> 对每个候选都要跑一次前向，延迟随候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性涨；<a href=\"../rerankers/llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a> 还要贵上一两个数量级。本篇把第二章各模型的推理结构翻译成可量化的工程账：延迟从哪来、怎么压、各类模型的成本结构、以及怎么在精度和预算之间找到那个划算的点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-重排延迟的构成\">核心概念：重排延迟的构成</h2><p>一次重排的总延迟主要由三项决定：候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、单候选打分耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、以及能否批处理。交叉编码器的核心公式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rerank</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{rerank}} \\approx \\frac{N}{B}\\cdot t_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rerank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是候选数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是批大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个批的前向耗时。关键在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性项——这是交叉编码器无法预计算（<a href=\"../foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder\">双编码器与交叉编码器</a> 解释过原因）的直接后果。压延迟的全部手段，都是在攻这三个变量之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  N[候选数 N] --&gt; T[总延迟 T]&#10;  B[批大小 B] --&gt; T&#10;  TB[单批前向 t] --&gt; T&#10;  N --&gt; R1[手段1 裁剪 N&lt;br/&gt;先粗排/收缩候选]&#10;  B --&gt; R2[手段2 增大 B&lt;br/&gt;批处理/GPU]&#10;  TB --&gt; R3[手段3 降 t&lt;br/&gt;小模型/量化/蒸馏]\">flowchart TD\n  N[候选数 N] --&gt; T[总延迟 T]\n  B[批大小 B] --&gt; T\n  TB[单批前向 t] --&gt; T\n  N --&gt; R1[手段1 裁剪 N&lt;br/&gt;先粗排/收缩候选]\n  B --&gt; R2[手段2 增大 B&lt;br/&gt;批处理/GPU]\n  TB --&gt; R3[手段3 降 t&lt;br/&gt;小模型/量化/蒸馏]</pre><h2 id=\"三类压延迟手段\">三类压延迟手段</h2><p>裁剪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。最直接——候选越少，重排越快。靠 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieve-then-rerank\">检索-重排两阶段</a> 的漏斗：第一阶段别一股脑给重排器几千条，先收缩到几百；或加一级廉价粗排（小交叉编码器/ColBERT）把候选压到几十，再上贵模型。这是性价比最高的手段，因为延迟随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性，砍一半 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 直接省一半时间。</p>\n<p>增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">‘</mi><mtext>（批处理）。</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B`（批处理）。</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">‘</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（批处理）。</span></span></span></span></span>N$ 个候选的前向彼此独立，可以打包成批一次喂给 GPU，吞吐远高于逐条。生产部署里批处理 + GPU 是把交叉编码器跑进可接受延迟的基础：bge-reranker-v2-m3 这类小模型在 GPU 上单批可做到 50~100ms（来源：2026 reranker 评测）。CPU 部署则慢得多，量大时几乎必须上 GPU。</p>\n<p>降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（更便宜的模型）。换小模型（<a href=\"../rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器选型</a> 里讲过小模型可追平大模型），或量化（INT8/FP8 把权重压小、推理加速），或用 <a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">蒸馏</a> 把大模型能力压进小模型。LLM 重排还可用 FIRST 式单 token 解码（<a href=\"../rerankers/llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a> 提过）避免逐字生成整条排序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>攻哪个变量</th>\n<th>增益</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>裁剪候选 N</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线性省时</td>\n<td>召回风险（漏答案）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加粗排级联</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大幅省贵模型调用</td>\n<td>多一级延迟与复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理+GPU</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>吞吐数倍</td>\n<td>GPU 成本、需攒批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小模型/量化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单次更快</td>\n<td>可能掉精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒸馏</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>快且保精度</td>\n<td>训练成本前置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本结构-自托管-vs-api\">成本结构：自托管 vs API</h2><p>延迟之外是钱。两种部署的成本结构截然不同，选型时要算总账。</p>\n<p>API（Cohere、Voyage 等）按调用量或 token 计费：无需运维、有 SLA、弹性好，但单价随量线性涨，量大到一定规模会比自托管贵得多，且数据要出域。自托管开源模型（BGE、Qwen3）是固定的 GPU 成本：前期要买/租卡和搭服务，但边际成本极低——一张卡可服务海量请求，量越大越划算，数据不出域。</p>\n<p>决策的经验法则：低/中流量、要快速上线、重合规省心 → API；高流量、有 GPU 运维能力、有数据合规要求 → 自托管。两者之间还有混合——平时自托管扛主流量，峰值溢出到 API。更系统的成本-延迟治理（缓存、模型分级、降级）见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/latency-anatomy\">延迟剖析</a> 与 <a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/model-tiering\">模型分级</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[选部署方式] --&gt; B{流量规模?}&#10;  B --&gt;|低/中 快速上线| C[API Cohere/Voyage&lt;br/&gt;免运维 有 SLA]&#10;  B --&gt;|高 + 数据合规| D[自托管 BGE/Qwen3&lt;br/&gt;固定 GPU 成本 边际低]&#10;  A --&gt; E{峰值波动大?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[混合 自托管打底+API 溢出]\">graph TD\n  A[选部署方式] --&gt; B{流量规模?}\n  B --&gt;|低/中 快速上线| C[API Cohere/Voyage&lt;br/&gt;免运维 有 SLA]\n  B --&gt;|高 + 数据合规| D[自托管 BGE/Qwen3&lt;br/&gt;固定 GPU 成本 边际低]\n  A --&gt; E{峰值波动大?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[混合 自托管打底+API 溢出]</pre><h2 id=\"怎么找划算的点\">怎么找划算的点</h2><p>最终是个优化问题：在延迟预算（如 P99 &lt; 200ms）和成本预算内，最大化 <a href=\"reranking-evaluation\">nDCG/MRR</a>。务实的做法是画「精度-延迟」曲线：固定候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，把几个候选模型（大/小/量化）都测一遍 nDCG 和延迟，挑曲线上的拐点——再加延迟换不来多少精度的那个点。</p>\n<p>几条经验。其一，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的边际收益递减：从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 加到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 可能涨几个点 nDCG，从 100 加到 500 几乎不动却让延迟翻几倍——存在一个甜区。其二，级联几乎总赢：用便宜模型把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 压到几十，再用贵模型精排，能在总延迟可控下逼近贵模型的精度。其三，先量化 ROI：重排带来的精度提升要值那点延迟和成本——若提升只有零点几个点 nDCG，可能不值得引入。这个 ROI 判断在 RAG 场景尤为重要，见 <a href=\"reranking-in-rag\">RAG 中的重排</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交叉编码器重排延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx (N/B)\\cdot t_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性，源于不可预计算。</li>\n<li>三类压延迟手段对应三个变量：裁剪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（最划算）、批处理+GPU（增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>）、小模型/量化/蒸馏（降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>成本结构：API 按量计费、免运维、量大变贵且数据出域；自托管固定 GPU 成本、边际极低、量大划算。</li>\n<li>找划算点：画精度-延迟曲线挑拐点；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 有边际递减甜区；级联几乎总赢；先量化重排的 ROI 再决定上不上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器重排</a> —— 延迟随 N 线性的模型根源。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"reranking-in-rag\">RAG 中的重排</a> —— RAG 场景的 ROI 与 N/k 取舍。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> —— 蒸馏换取「快且准」。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/latency-anatomy\">延迟剖析</a> —— 端到端延迟构成。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/model-tiering\">模型分级</a> —— 级联/分级路由的成本治理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延迟与成本取舍","id":"延迟与成本取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：重排延迟的构成","id":"核心概念-重排延迟的构成"},{"level":2,"text":"三类压延迟手段","id":"三类压延迟手段"},{"level":2,"text":"成本结构：自托管 vs API","id":"成本结构-自托管-vs-api"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么找划算的点","id":"怎么找划算的点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"评测 nDCG/MRR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/reranking-evaluation"},"next":{"title":"RAG 中的重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/reranking-in-rag"}}